# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-06-22 13:15

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:6
translate english day1_call_mikko_eec11c5f:

    # m "Старый друг! Чем занят?"
    m "Old friend! What are you up to?"

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:7
translate english day1_call_mikko_740b9cf0:

    # k "Чиню, как обычно"
    k "Fixing things, as usual."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:8
translate english day1_call_mikko_a218ea78:

    # m "Слышал, был взрыв у магнитной дороги сегодня?"
    m "Did you hear there was an explosion near the magnetic road today?"

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:9
translate english day1_call_mikko_43950ec7:

    # k "Неа, что случилось?"
    k "Nope. What happened?"

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:10
translate english day1_call_mikko_3425eb0b:

    # m "Не знаю, я проходил рядом, такой фейерверк, видел там Линь Чи — она тоже всё удивлялась, откуда столько жестокости в людях."
    m "No idea. I was passing by—looked like fireworks. Saw Linh Chi there too. She kept wondering where people get so much cruelty from."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:11
translate english day1_call_mikko_37e4f7b2:

    # k "Мда."
    k "Yeah."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:12
translate english day1_call_mikko_614d08a2:

    # m "Кстати, сегодня я собираюсь встретиться с другом, он охранник склада запчастей, он хороший малый."
    m "By the way, I'm meeting a friend today. He's a guard at a parts warehouse. Good guy."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:13
translate english day1_call_mikko_b531400e:

    # k "Интересно."
    k "Interesting."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:14
translate english day1_call_mikko_161517e8:

    # m "If you get him talking, he might share a few things. The corporation will just write it off as something that fell... or broke. We just need to buy something and treat him."
    m "If you get him talking, he might hand over a few things. The corporation will just write it off as something that fell... or broke. We just need to buy something and treat him."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:15
translate english day1_call_mikko_a55947a0:

    # k "Я подумаю"
    k "I'll think about it."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:20
translate english day1_call_mikko_851076a9:

    # m "Ты соскучился за пять минут?"
    m "Missed me after five minutes already?"

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:21
translate english day1_call_mikko_20dda96d:

    # k "Всё ещё думаю над твоим предложением"
    k "Still thinking about your offer."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:22
translate english day1_call_mikko_59c31905:

    # m "Думай недолго, мы собираемся хорошо погулять, буду недоступен"
    m "Don't think too long. We're about to have a good time, so I'll be unavailable."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:26
translate english day1_call_mikko_e612037c:

    # m "..."
    m "..."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:27
translate english day1_call_mikko_8e68e31e:

    # "Микко не отвечает."
    "Mikko doesn't answer."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:28
translate english day1_call_mikko_96390ead:

    # k "Возможно, я его застану дома, если выдвинуться сейчас"
    k "Maybe I'll catch him at home if I leave right now."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:35
translate english day1_hangout_mikko_1e19faab:

    # m "Без пяти кредитов никак, его же надо угостить."
    m "Can't do it without five credits. We need to treat him, after all."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:38
translate english day1_hangout_mikko_e3171d45:

    # "Вы отправили кредиты - 5 штук"
    "You sent 5 credits."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:43
translate english day1_hangout_mikko_010305f0:

    # "Вечер начался спокойно. Микко познакомил вас со своим приятелем — охранником склада запчастей."
    "The evening started quietly. Mikko introduced you to his friend—a guard at a parts warehouse."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:45
translate english day1_hangout_mikko_1894593b:

    # "Тот оказался разговорчивым мужиком и после нескольких стопок внезапно решил, что двое прохожих на другой стороне улицы слишком подозрительно на него смотрят."
    "The guy turned out to be quite talkative, and after a few shots he suddenly decided that two pedestrians across the street were looking at him far too suspiciously."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:47
translate english day1_hangout_mikko_b38d62f7:

    # "Пока охранник собирался выяснить отношения, Микко пытался отвлечь его разговорами, а вам пришлось буквально разворачивать его за плечи и убеждать, что никто не собирается захватывать склад."
    "While the guard was getting ready to confront them, Mikko tried to distract him with conversation, and you had to physically turn him around by the shoulders and convince him that nobody was planning to seize the warehouse."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:49
translate english day1_hangout_mikko_405ad35f:

    # "К счастью, до драки дело не дошло."
    "Fortunately, it never came to a fight."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:51
translate english day1_hangout_mikko_2c1ca0d9:

    # "Спустя час охранник уже смеялся над собственной выходкой так громко, что его было слышно на соседней улице."
    "An hour later, the guard was laughing at his own antics so loudly that people could hear him from the next street over."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:53
translate english day1_hangout_mikko_d7120688:

    # "Перед уходом он ненадолго исчез внутри склада, а затем вернулся с мотком хорошшего провода."
    "Before leaving, he disappeared into the warehouse for a moment and returned with a spool of high-quality wire."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:57
translate english day1_hangout_mikko_1ec1f2a0:

    # "Получен провод."
    "Received wire."

# game/communications/micko/day1_micko.rpy:59
translate english day1_hangout_mikko_1275f39e:

    # "Микко потом ещё долго уверял вас, что сегодня его приятель вёл себя исключительно прилично."
    "Afterward, Mikko spent a long time assuring you that his friend had behaved exceptionally well today."